  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diourbel Cereal Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The union seeks to expand its production and number of members through technical training, the construction of warehouses and transformation of local produces. -&quot; The warehouse financed by USADF will improve storage conditions for our production. Loss will be minimized (increase in quantity) and the hygienic storage conditions will improve the quality of our production (increase in selling price).&quot;.-&quot; The purchase of two boats will triple the quantity of fish we catch.&quot;.-&quot; The working capital requested will enable farmers to buy improved seeds. This, and the agricultural training financed by the project, will increase the farmers&apos; harvests. We will buy and sell any surplus production from the farmers.&quot;.- The funding received will enable stakeholders to set up agricultural farms and market gardening perimeters, units to process produce to minimize losses..The project will buy certified seeds, train producers in Good Agricultural Practices (GAP), increase yields, and buy and sell farmers&apos; surplus produce.</narrative>
  </description>
